1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,734
This is chloroform, trichloromethane.

2
00:00:02,734 --> 00:00:07,408
In eighteen forty seven it became one of the first general anaesthetics.

3
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:08,932
Look at how it is stored.

4
00:00:08,932 --> 00:00:10,859
Always in a dark brown bottle.

5
00:00:10,859 --> 00:00:13,242
Always filled right to the brim.

6
00:00:13,242 --> 00:00:16,341
And always with about one percent of ethanol added.

